7. Application Workflow
The complete workflow should be:
Step 1 — Select a Disaster
The user selects a disaster case containing satellite imagery.
Step 2 — View Satellite Images
The dashboard displays the original images from before and after the disaster.
Step 3 — Run AI Analysis
The user clicks "Analyze with AI".
The application sends the post-disaster image to the pretrained SegFormer model.
Step 4 — Display Damage Detection
The model generates a segmentation mask showing different damage severity levels.
Step 5 — Calculate Zone Priorities
The application divides the image into nine zones and calculates a severity score for each one.
Step 6 — Rank the Zones
Zones are ranked from highest to lowest estimated severity.
Step 7 — Present Results
The dashboard displays the colored zone overlay, ranking table, summary statistics, and explanations.
All displayed predictions must come from actual model inference.
